description: "Have you ever wonder what it's like to do your efforts? only to see that no one appreciated you enough? they see you only as a small thing or entirely nothing?"
details: "I have that same feeling Scavenger... I kept myself thinking if i am important or insignificant, I wanted to be seen, not be something to forget."

